=2 Walkthrough
* Approach the chocobo stable in Upper Jeuno (G-7).

:* You may have to zone after completing the previous quest.

* Complete the {p:The Celestial Nexus II}, **__on any difficulty**__, to get the {k:Broken flying machine} Key Item.
* Report back to {n:Mapitoto}.
* Interact with the {q:Strange Apparatus|Strange Apparatus|Strange Apparatus} in {z:Fei'Yin} (G-6 map 1).

:* You will need to proceed to the basement (H-9, Map 1) or warp to the __Fauregandi__ > __Fei'Yin__ > __Home Point #2__.

::* Then proceed back upstairs from (E-7, Map 2) to (G/H-6, Map 1) to run through the fake wall and to the Apparatus. All apparatuses are hidden like this.

* Obtain a {@i:Vlg. Coffer Key|1060} {i:Ve'Lugannon Coffer Key|Ve'Lugannon Coffer Key|1060} and open a coffer in {z:Ve'Lugannon Palace} to obtain the {k:Levitation device} Key Item.

:* {p:Curio Vendor Moogles|Curio Vendor Moogle} sell the Coffer Key for 5,000 gil.
:* If you are in a party, all members will receive the Key Item when one member opens a coffer.
:** **{c=red:Notice:}** If someone who's in your party __but doesn't need__ the Key Item opens the coffer, **no one will get the Key Item.**
:** **Advice:** You can make a full party, leave 1 person at each blue/yellow gate control and send others to find the coffer. As long as __someone who needs the Key Item opens the coffer__, everyone in the same party (not alliance) within the zone will get it.

* Obtain {q:Doctor Status|Strange Apparatus|Doctor Status} from any {q:Strange Apparatus|Strange Apparatus|Strange Apparatus} and return to the one in {z:Fei'Yin} and examine the Apparatus.

:* You will not be able to obtain {q:Doctor Status|Strange Apparatus|Doctor Status} from the apparatus in {z:Fei'Yin}.

::* Once obtained, the status will persist after obtaining it in another zone and returning.
::* **Warning:** Don't accidentally trade your items to a Strange Apparatus in a zone other than {z:Fei'Yin} for this quest! You will lose them.

:* Optional: If you want to save time for the {k:Omega whistle}, talk to {n:Boisterous Jackal} in {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-7) twice times to gain the ability to enable {q:Administrator Status|Strange Apparatus|Administrator Status} in {z:Fei'Yin}.
:** This was changed at some point, as of July 2026. Speaking with Boisterous Jackal is not necessary, just interact with the apparatus again after getting the Whirring engine key item.

* Trade the {@i:Green Chip|477} {i:Green Chip|Green Chip|477} and {@i:Infinity Core|1474} {i:Infinity Core|Infinity Core|1474} to the apparatus in {z:Fei'Yin}.

:* The apparatus will then ask for 38 {@g:Cluster Cycle Quest} elemental crystal Clusters. Any combination of elements works.

* Trade the stacks of Clusters to obtain the {k:Whirring engine} Key Item.
* Return to {n:Mapitoto} to get the {k:Levitus key} Key Item.
** **{c=orange:Note:}** The {i:Levitus} inventory item exists in the game, but you are given the Key Item directly.

